OL,3,GNEWSAFootball club buys back land
OL,4,Aaround its stadium
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football club has announced the
OL,7,Fpurchase of land around its stadium.
OL,9,FWeymouth FC said it had concluded a
OL,10,Fdeal to put the land back in the club's
OL,11,Fname after 18 years.
OL,13,FChairman Ralph Ricardo said he hoped
OL,14,Fthe purchase would allow the club to
OL,15,Fopen a full-size artificial pitch
OL,16,Fbeside the existing stadium,
OL,17,Fbenefitting the community at large.
OL,19,FIn an announcement on the club website,
OL,20,Fhe said: "Today is a proud day for
OL,21,Feveryone who cares about the Terras.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
